abstract: >
  GraphMerge is the world's first open-source reference implementation of graph-structured
  distributed block optimization for parallel AI coding agents, resolving the merge degradation
  paradox with a provable 1/chi_f(G) objective preservation guarantee (arXiv:2610.30074).
